+--[[
+	Behavior spec for ReplicatedStorage.Shared.PlacementRules. Each test checks a rule from the
+	module's doc comments through its public functions (snap and validate), so refactoring the
+	module's internals shouldn't break it.
+
+	Assumptions:
+	- The concrete numbers below assume BlockTypes.BlockSize = 4, PlacementRules.MaxHeight = 200,
+	  and PlacementRules.MaxReach = 24. The first test checks this so a tuning change fails with a
+	  clear message instead of a confusing boundary failure.
+	- Rejection tests check the reason string so we know which rule rejected the request (a request
+	  can break more than one rule). The reasons are log text, so rewording one means updating the
+	  matching test here.
+	- Every test builds its own occupied table; none share state or depend on order.
+]]
